The '''2022 Blackburn with Darwen Borough Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Blackburn with Darwen Borough Council]] in England. This was on the same day as other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|local elections]]. One-third of the seats were up for election.

